## 🚨 CRITICAL NEXT STEPS (Manual)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Code changes alone won't make you rank #1. You MUST complete these steps:

### 1. Google Search Console Setup
1. Go to [Google Search Console](https://search.google.com/search-console)
2. Click **"Add Property"** → enter `https://sharan-raj-ai.github.io`
3. Choose **HTML tag verification** method
4. Copy the verification code like: `<meta name="google-site-verification" content="YOUR_CODE" />`
5. Update [layout.tsx](file:///home/asttecs/Downloads/sharan-site/src/app/layout.tsx) line 63: replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION_CODE` with your code
6. Push the change, then verify in Search Console

### 2. Submit Sitemap
- In Search Console → **Sitemaps** → submit: `https://sharan-raj-ai.github.io/sitemap.xml`

### 3. Request Indexing
- In Search Console → **URL Inspection** → enter your URL → click **"Request Indexing"**

